极端火灾提醒人们忽视与气候相关的资产价值威胁的危险。他在接受采访时表示，全球变暖可能会影响“任何投资的风险和回报”。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;请记住订阅 Bloomberg.com，以便&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/r7-uLMa_cdmlyVrcjlh1vgMHgq359GRsrvObMk4ri0ILQPASIQ9QNxs4e_q8dHI2mYq9LPzUKgfeHPgHBhEyyt3le-v3FQSd_JY9wxPXeq2OcLAmSEsKQNOF3W8RUuYm1fM7ZiImOoMowwFDCUD6x8vg_0klNrGAYEqJccESQNxhTVHrOADay6smNGrTiOO0HvBXuPCdyAva9aX_FWK5YwXWQKLCxEDIFQsZekdFLbHbbbgkD0Ffa2Xvl6soxMSlogDcPpMIVCjudnnVkoCVrpKcmRj-3VDey8rEbhGtQbVUyMq_QU-1OmW8gIIhuKR6xX2prpkWDBmTVJIDSu2V3KXB41eiL5YY-eLbRrokCrpHANq4e0hQxfsg4ZzRJQkfklhxqlgzrYuN929mvLONJ6U36dBO6Qs4QbR9GQi3P8JbrLKknaoANFY2IdjAQmWMzz5eAcML3aHEN91yoXBB/wJzLnj_AqZ2dMC0gA9DsA_9jxVX-oRw7/22?cmpid=BBD072826_GREENDAILY&amp;amp;utm_campaign=greendaily&amp;amp;utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_term=260728&amp;amp;utm_content=7060" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="彭博订阅|数字化、全方位、企业和学生"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;无限制地访问&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;我们有关气候变化、清洁能源和极端天气的所有报道。&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;为投资者敲响警钟&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;作者： &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/-EFdg6FlCiVBCS-6uTkHtSXdYybG8gQ_D0_PHpSJLlqA0xrlvdzz3Xgzatru4lR-LtHiLDxmRgk9_CTC5_Ly0rfuAJIPzP8YSZuh_gqu7ZRbggm0fZWiz0O8X7zefO3R5z-Sn-l0IddCaCOX42kH1GxKLlB9TEVctZHLt_b3MghxJxXlQRDty7ODzRBZ1U1jotXu_InlPph62-BtxeJC0XLULh2gGvdAkDStdFwlQpbIoJIv4u9reYxUPbXBvh19DNwlY7piQtrtC1eNsK9wlKgBKheKi_-Q15RoSYuLXRWmVTwt2UZFobYnzl8YW2-qtXvG_H4o5_U01NWBPmvS6rp_uvaPlPFmMniZsFD83aHI-YA2eQsfPsmu2wNdz8alN63sGLERmbfTf57OJFIoXS_41aG_M8itqhtaJlfOA0m9HcEPZpTWufXF9frizrNuJy2vJ6H1oV0RU_RNTHkLDtuqW1o3RhqwNFl2H1E-zH6TrQcZ/WXD7IE9VmTsL5DxOl6TnnPm7k8UbM4lO/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style